OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of bike event on Dales to
OL,4,Abe assessed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to reduce the impact of an
OL,7,Foff-road motorcycling event on ancient
OL,8,Fwoodland and archaeological remains in
OL,9,Fthe Yorkshire Dales are to be drawn up.
OL,11,FAbout 200 riders take part in the Scott
OL,12,FTrial, which spans 130km (81 miles) in
OL,13,Fthe Dales and attracts some of the best
OL,14,Ftrail bike riders in the world.
OL,16,FEvent organisers had initially wanted
OL,17,Feither a five-year extension to their
OL,18,Fplanning permission terms, or consent
OL,19,Ffor the trial to continue permanently.
OL,20,FBut they have now amended their
OL,21,Fapplication to ask for temporary
OL,22,Fconsent to keep the event going.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
