OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of bike event on Dales to
OL,4,Abe assessed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Yorkshire Dales National Park
OL,7,FAuthority has asked for a conservation
OL,8,Fmanagement plan alongside any future
OL,9,Fproposal for the trial to be permanent.
